    pr_ref:  # 25d5
    description: "Repro (dev 77cca016e9): public @interface Tag { String value(); class Nested { void run() {} } } -> symbols Nested and Nested.run only: no Tag symbol, no Tag.value element, and Nested is not Tag.Nested. Consequence: annotation types are invisible to search/explain/dead-code, and a nested type's id can collide with a same-named top-level type. Found while fixing WI-fimim (PR #2091), whose export rule already treats annotation_type_body members as public."  # 25d5
